Subject: [PATCH 0065] EXPERIMENT: Apple compat AFPCR DAZ/FTZ restore family

Gate: MACRUNNER_FEX_APPLE_AFP=1 plus verified native-thread compat admission.
Distinct from Arm FEAT_AFP; default off.
Native hardware sentinel: hw2-afpcr-native-20261003T081732Z, 3 equal runs.

--- a/CodeEmitter/CodeEmitter/Emitter.h
+++ b/CodeEmitter/CodeEmitter/Emitter.h
@@ -361,6 +361,8 @@
   RNDRRS = GenSystemReg<0b11, 0b011, 0b0010, 0b0100, 0b001>,
   NZCV = GenSystemReg<0b11, 0b011, 0b0100, 0b0010, 0b000>,
   FPCR = GenSystemReg<0b11, 0b011, 0b0100, 0b0100, 0b000>,
+  // Apple x86 FP mode (ACTLR.EnAFP), distinct from Arm FEAT_AFP.
+  AFPCR_EL0 = GenSystemReg<3, 6, 15, 2, 5>,
   FPSR = GenSystemReg<0b11, 0b011, 0b0100, 0b0100, 0b001>, // MacRunner: x87 fast path saves/restores the cumulative flags
   TPIDRRO_EL0 = GenSystemReg<0b11, 0b011, 0b1101, 0b0000, 0b011>,
   CNTFRQ_EL0 = GenSystemReg<0b11, 0b011, 0b1110, 0b0000, 0b000>,
